/*TODO: The pronunciation of the adjective "red" is "AR ED".*/

A colour is a color.

Red, green, blue, yellow, cyan, magenta, black, white, grey, pink, brown, orange, violet,
purple, /*TODO: navy blue,*/ turquoise, silver, gold, bronze  are colors.

